  m_Name: Golden Ice Grenade launcher_GunData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Winter's Kiss
  descriptionEnglish: Winter's Kiss is a highly effective ice grenade launcher, favored
    by demon hunters for generations. Upon impact, it unleashes a frigid blast that
    freezes demons solid, leaving them vulnerable. Azaus counts it among his favorite
    weapons, and has used it to devastating effect against hordes of demons.
  nameChinese: "\u5BD2\u51B0\u4E4B\u543B"
  descriptionChinese: "\u5BD2\u51B0\u4E4B\u543B\u662F\u4E00\u6B3E\u5907\u53D7\u4EE3\u4EE3\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\u9752\u7750\u7684\u9AD8\u6548\u51B0\u9730\u5F39\u53D1\u5C04\u5668\u3002\u5B83\u649E\u51FB\u76EE\u6807\u540E\u91CA\u653E\u51FA\u5BD2\u51B7\u7684\u51B0\u51BB\u80FD\u91CF\uFF0C\u5C06\u6076\u9B54\u51BB\u7ED3\u6210\u575A\u51B0\uFF0C\u4F7F\u5176\u9677\u5165\u8106\u5F31\u7684\u72B6\u6001\u3002Azaus
    \u5C06\u5176\u5217\u4E3A\u6700\u559C\u6B22\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u4E4B\u4E00\uFF0C\u5E76\u7528\u5B83\u5BF9\u6297\u5927\u6279\u7684\u6076\u9B54\uFF0C\u8FBE\u5230\u4E86\u60CA\u4EBA\u7684\u6548\u679C\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Beijo do Inverno
  descriptionPortuguese: "um lan\xE7ador de granadas de gelo altamente eficaz, favorecido
    pelos ca\xE7adores de dem\xF4nios h\xE1 gera\xE7\xF5es. Ao impacto, ele libera
    uma explos\xE3o fria que congela os dem\xF4nios, deixando-os vulner\xE1veis.
    Azaus o considera uma de suas armas favoritas e j\xE1 o utilizou com efeito devastador
    contra hordas de dem\xF4nios."
  nameSpanish: El Beso del Invierno
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "El Beso del Invierno es un lanzagranadas de hielo altamente
    efectivo, favorecido por cazadores de demonios durante generaciones. Al impactar,
    libera una explosi\xF3n fr\xEDgida que congela a los demonios s\xF3lidos, dej\xE1ndolos
    vulnerables. Azaus lo cuenta entre sus armas favoritas y lo ha usado con efecto
    devastador contra hordas de demonios."
